    "created_at": "2023-09-25T11:56:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-09-25T11:56:56Z",
    "body": "It is not correct to use \"the\" when referring to variables in spec language, so this change is not correct.\r\n\r\nOne potential fix here is to move the algorithm toward using modern style _camelCase_ variables. However, I wouldn't want to do this for only a single variable. Are you up for a PR that updates all the variables in the adoption agency to that modern style?",
